<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-BORRELLI CLEARED TO JOIN REAL OVIEDO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BORRELLI CLEARED TO JOIN REAL OVIEDO.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juan Jose Borrelli was cleared to play for Real Oviedo on Monday after FIFA rejected an appeal by Panathinaikos to block the transfer.</p>
<p>FIFA upheld the decision taken by the Players' Status Committee in October that Borrelli's transfer to the Spanish club was valid and would take effect on January 1.</p>
<p>Borrelli was suspended from playing for the Athens side until his move.</p>
</text>
